ensive or offensive benefit.\n\nReason: Sacrificing the a4 pawn is unavoidable, but R: a1-a3 converts the situation into active initiative. The check after recapture (Ra4+) exploits Black's king position, potentially leading to material gain or mating threats. Other moves neglect this tactical opportunity.\n\nAnswer: R: a1-a3"}
